18-04-2000 Eddie Penninkhof
- Created mkxbvars, a utility to create the xbvars.bat file.
- Adapted xapp.xxx for the multi-directory structure.
- Added tools on which the binary distribution depends to the repository.

14-04-2000 Eddie Penninkhof
- Split xut.x into xut.x and xutpde.x. xutpde.x is ONLY used by the PDE;
  xut.x is used by both the PDE and user programs.

11-04-2000 Eddie Penninkhof
- XBasic base-directory is now retrieved from full path of executable
  (can be overruled by XBDIR environment-variable).
- Created a setup-script for Inno Setup (win32)
- Commandline-parsing now handles quotes. Spaces inside quotes are not
  treated as command-line separators.
  e.g. "c:\Program Files\XBasic\bin\xb.exe" is now 1 argument.
- File Load/Save now default to the current directory.
- XuiFile no longer skips directories with the archive bit set.
